      "description": "Gene set passed to upstream args.test_pathway. Use all_expression_genes to create a temporary user-defined list from the expression gene ids, or select one of DigNet's bundled human KEGG pathway ids. The selected upstream CSV path accepts only selected gene sets with 10 to 200 genes and still requires expression gene ids to match DigNet's bundled human RegNetwork/KEGG gene symbols; all_expression_genes does not make synthetic or non-human ids compatible.",
